# Docker build-context excludes.
#
# Mirrors Poppy's services/poppy-tts/.dockerignore, plus the Forage-specific
# paths the image never needs (git history, the test suite, the KitTools
# scaffold). Keeps the build context small — measured well under 5 MB.
#
# Note: .dockerignore patterns are root-anchored, so caches need an explicit
# `**/` form to be pruned out of subdirectories too.

.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
**/*.pyc
.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
*.egg-info

.git/
tests/
kit_tools/
